'''Fremennik warband seers''' are enemies encountered in the [[Fortis Colosseum]]. They appear at the start of each wave (except wave 12 without Quartet), alongside a [[Fremennik warband archer]] and [[Fremennik warband berserker]]. Attacking them with ranged will always result in a max hit. If attacking with [[Ice Barrage]], the player needs at least a +104 magic attack bonus with [[Augury]] to guarantee a freeze, or +140 without. This will not guarantee a max hit.

They are able to use routefinding, and as such will move around pillars to reach players. They attack on a fixed 6 tick cycle, only attacking when they are in melee distance and are not moving.

